sequenceDiagram
  participant C as client
  participant J as httpjet pipeline
  participant W as WAF sidecar<br/>(loopback, e.g. Coraza adapter)
  C->>J: request
  J->>J: decode/normalize URI · enforce body limit · resolve client IP
  J->>J: reserve serialization allowance (64 MiB process budget) within --waf-timeout-ms
  J->>W: POST /inspect {"version":1, method, path, query, vhost, client_ip, protocol, tls, headers_hex, body_hex ≤ --waf-body-max | body_omitted:true}
  alt 204 + Content-Length: 0
    W-->>J: allow
    J->>J: continue: rewrite → cache → dispatch
  else 403 + Content-Length: 0
    W-->>J: block
    J-->>C: 403
  else timeout · EOF · other status · malformed head (> 4 KiB)
    W--xJ: sidecar failure
    J-->>C: 503 (fail-closed) — or continue if --waf-fail-open (logged)
  end
  Note over J,W: one close-delimited HTTP/1.1 request per inspection — connections never reused
